extends layout

block content
  section.page-header
    .wrap
      h1 Our story
      p How a love for baking became Kampala's go-to confectionery for life's sweetest moments.

  section.band-ivory
    .wrap.about-grid
      .about-photo
        img(src="/assets/lisa_avatar_square.jpg" alt="Angel Lisa Nansubuga, founder of Lisa Confectionery")
      div
        .section-head(style="margin-bottom:20px;")
          .kicker Meet the founder
          h2 Angel Lisa Nansubuga
        p Angel Lisa Nansubuga is a doctor by profession and a baker at heart. What began as baking for family and friends has grown into Lisa Confectionery — a bakery dealing in cakes for all occasions: birthdays, showers, graduation parties, traditional marriages, weddings and more, alongside cupcakes, cookies and doughnuts.
        p Every order is baked and hand-decorated to order in Kawempe Division, Kampala. Our mission is simple: to indulge your sweet tooth with lovely baked goods bursting with flavour, made specially for your celebration.
        .about-stats
          div
            strong 391+
            span Cakes &amp; treats documented
          div
            strong 10.8K
            span TikTok community
          div
            strong By appointment
            span Kanyanya Road, Kampala

  section.band-cream
    .wrap
      .section-head
        .kicker Our mission
        h2 What we bake for
      .value-grid
        .value-card
          span.ic 🍰
          h4 Made from scratch
          p Every cake is baked, filled and decorated to order — no pre-made shortcuts.
        .value-card
          span.ic 🎉
          h4 For every occasion
          p Birthdays, bridal &amp; baby showers, introductions, weddings and traditional marriages.
        .value-card
          span.ic 💬
          h4 Personal service
          p We work with you directly to get size, flavour and design just right.

  section.band-ivory
    .wrap
      .section-head
        .kicker The team
        h2 Who's baking your cake
      .team-grid
        .team-card
          img(src="/assets/lisa_avatar_square.jpg" alt="Angel Lisa Nansubuga")
          h4 Angel Lisa Nansubuga
          span Founder &amp; Head Baker

  section.band-espresso
    .wrap(style="text-align:center;")
      h2(style="max-width:none;") Ready to plan your cake?
      p(style="margin:0 auto 22px; color:var(--blush);") Tell us your date, flavour and design idea and we'll take it from there.
      a.btn.btn-gold(href="/book") Start your booking →
